# Patch-ID: P-TAB-001 / P-NAV-001 (wave 12, initial document)
# Area: tab.
# Rationale: preserve the initial empty document rather than racing a synthetic
#   about:blank commit with the first real destination. Avoid eager DevTools
#   access and empty-plan work, while retaining acknowledged registrations over
#   admitted file/WebUI visits. Hidden/occlusion policy remains unchanged.
# Last-Rebased: 2026-11-02 (Chromium 156.0.8078.74).
# Frozen-file exceptions: existing ABI/services only. No renderer retry,
#   process priority change, helper blanket initialization or visibility bypass.
#   Internal protocol attachment survives WebUI/file, but host expression and
#   capture calls reject them; boosts/peek remain http(s)-scoped.
# Validation: build-p33; smoke-tab022 G1-G5; native core/services/URLs/eval/
#   HTTP-WebUI-HTTP-file-HTTP hosts; 30 hidden + 30 attached first loads,
#   zero placeholder commits/timeouts; nm-tab022. Mock-Keychain timing median
#   remains ~1.25s: this does not claim to cure the real OS authorization wait.

diff --git a/chrome/browser/rearc_bridge/rearc_engine_abi.h b/chrome/browser/rearc_bridge/rearc_engine_abi.h
